Star footballer Neymar has been recovered to join his team during training session. 
 Neymar is fit to play in a friendly against Croatia in Liverpool on 3rd June.
Brazil aren\'t as reliant as they once were on Neymar. 

Brazil won four times in the six games played without Neymar.

Injured defender Dani Alves will not go to Russia.

Under Coach Tite’s two years tenure Brazil is turned from a flop into favourites.

Brazil will begin their hunt for a record sixth World Cup title against Switzerland on 17th June.

